  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 8th level, the crimson dancer’s magic becomes even stronger upon bleeding foes. When attempting to establish blood control with the Blood sphere, creatures with less than half their maximum hit points suffer a -6 penalty to their save, rather than a -4 penalty. Additionally, the crimson dancer can concentrate on blood control with only a move action, but still requires a standard action to establish it. Each round when she would concentrate on her blood control, she can spend 4 points of vitae to instead concentrate as a swift action, rather than a move action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/crimson-dancer#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
